      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "msgctxt": "512204",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "msgctxt": "512272",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "msgctxt": "512312",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "msgctxt": "512344",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "msgctxt": "512376",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…I hear the nearby sound of water running.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "msgctxt": "512420",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've felt this coaster, which descends into the\ncenter of minds, a few times before. It resembles\na boat being drawn through a whirlpool into Hell.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "512568",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I was born from an ocean of pleasure.\nFrom an ocean of milk that would melt itself,\nmelt even those who would protect it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "512692",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I was invisible. Formless, with an empty mind.\nI was an #C000246204Ego#CDEF that only melted, stole, and\nconverted into itself all that it touched.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "512840",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Lifeforms, to me, are nothing more than\nnutrients. They are as #ROFS-002#RUBScapsules#RUBEpills#REND that I let tumble\nabout in the palm of my hand.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "512992",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "To me, the world is a boring dish on a table,\nor a castle of sand made on the beach.\nIt all gets washed away and sent back to me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "513124",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ahh, but then――\nthen, I learned about love.\nI learned what it's like to be in love.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "513212",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The thought corrupted me completely.\nI'm no longer a shapeless #C000246204Ego#CDEF.\nI'm no longer aimless pleasure.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "513328",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In order to protect you, the object of my love,\nI offer my #RUBSeverything#RUBEentire body#REND.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "513428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Giving another your entire self―full control of\nboth mind and body. It's a fitting form of love\nfor one who assimilates and absorbs.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "513564",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C000246204Meltlilith#CDEF… Your thoughts may be evil, but your\ndevotion to your love seems genuine.\nStill, it goes a step too far.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "513700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I feel her stare. She wants me to look at her.\nBut it's ok. I have no feelings for #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nHer love is all wrong.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "513836",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She'll offer everything, she says?\nHow could something born out of self-indulgence\never protect anyone else's happiness?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "513960",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hmph.\nDoes she not realize such vows will deny her\nof her very self? How blind can she be?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "514052",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A being born from a desire to control has awoken\nto a desire to protect. Ready to become foam and\nfade. Sounds like a familiar children's tale.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "514196",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I have only you. You only have me.\nI will remold this world to keep it that way.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "514280",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You are a bamboo boat, the one little light\nin this world left to sail across me――\nyour ocean.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "514380",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But don't worry. In my ocean, wind does not\nblow. Waves do not rise over. Mine is a calm\nocean you can cross in peace.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "514500",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A boundless world without end where\nI'll continue tolerating you forever.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "514576",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "And so, I beg you…\ndrown and melt into the sweet nectar.\nForget even your own name.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "514664",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Find rest within me, worthless and with\nyour mouth shut forevermore.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "514736",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "As the ice melts into its water,\nas the sugar dissolves into its honey,\nwe will let nothing come between us.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "514848",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In my arms, you will become my love.\nWhere else in the world could you find greater\n#ROFS0003#RUBS happiness#RUBEpleasure#REND than this?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "514988",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'm a tad late to be saying this, but isn't\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF the spitting image of a naive little\ngirl? More so than #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, I'd argue…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "515156",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "While there is no ocean like that in this world,\nto call it \"paradise\" is a stretch.\nNo, the life she promises you is Hell itself.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "515288",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A calm sea is anything but peaceful. It's dead.\nHer idea of love is giving her tepid embrace to\nthe lifeless corpse of her choosing.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "515424",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Everything is to be within her? She's more of a\nlittle girl than a woman. I thought only\na goddess could love her playthings this way.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "515560",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…I learned about love. I learned your name.\nI want you to tell me everything about yourself.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "515656",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The mingling of breaths and bodily fluids?\nThe laying of skin on skin?\nThese are all superficial pleasures.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "515764",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "With absorption comes true understanding.\nI'll dissolve you and mix your all into my\nperson. I'll give you all of me in return.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "515892",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That is what makes#ROFS0002#RUBS    the perfect world#RUBE me Meltlilith#REND――\na supreme cradle made solely for you.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "516012",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You'll never suffer again,\nfor everything will be made for you out of me:\nlove, wanting love, fear, hurt, everything.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "516132",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Close your eyes and shut your mouth.\nYou are me, and I am love.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "516196",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The sugar that dissolves into honey,\nthe you that dissolves into my affection.\nThat love, all of it, belongs to me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "516312",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In complete contrast to the cruel #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nwe pass through warm thoughts.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "516408",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "These are her true feelings.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "516440",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A mind that deeply wishes for her lover's\nhappiness to the point of losing itself.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "516524",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Be that as it may, it's clear that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF\nand I aren't on the same page.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "516620",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Even if she hasn't the slightest intent to kill,\nshe's still an enemy we need to defeat if we're\nto move forward.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "516736",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Figuratively speaking, we're looking at the\neleventh hour.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "516796",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I steel my mind and descend,\ndown to the bottom of this ocean of pleasure.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "516872",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That way, I can reject this obsessive love\nat its very core――",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
